{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00485",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 1.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.41,
      "end_seconds": 10.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.17,
      "end_seconds": 13.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "I've been dealing with blurry vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.9,
      "end_seconds": 17.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.49,
      "end_seconds": 22.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Probably three weeks. Yeah. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.49,
      "end_seconds": 31.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.91,
      "end_seconds": 49.09,
      "duration_seconds": 17.18,
      "text": "Right, it settles a little with squinting. Yes, reading. That makes it worse. Mild, I'd say. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I, I had trouble reading small print before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.99,
      "end_seconds": 54.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Any sudden loss of vision, flashes of light or floaters at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.58,
      "end_seconds": 58.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Hmm, no. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.63,
      "end_seconds": 62.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.24,
      "end_seconds": 80.62,
      "duration_seconds": 14.38,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure for two years now. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I've got diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.98,
      "end_seconds": 85.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known diabetes. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.58,
      "end_seconds": 89.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I'm just saving what we've covered so far."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.47,
      "end_seconds": 103.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "That's saved, thanks for waiting. Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.18,
      "end_seconds": 108.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Pollen. I come out in... well, a runny nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.51,
      "end_seconds": 113.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.97,
      "end_seconds": 114.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.13,
      "end_seconds": 125.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.76,
      "end_seconds": 129.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.99,
      "end_seconds": 134.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.76,
      "end_seconds": 144.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day. It's Glycomet, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.54,
      "end_seconds": 147.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.24,
      "end_seconds": 149.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "It's 500 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.57,
      "end_seconds": 154.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.6,
      "end_seconds": 171.2,
      "duration_seconds": 15.6,
      "text": "Well, um, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.68,
      "end_seconds": 177.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.27,
      "end_seconds": 183.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "My mother has diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.65,
      "end_seconds": 187.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.58,
      "end_seconds": 190.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Of course, uh, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.38,
      "end_seconds": 216.7,
      "duration_seconds": 14.32,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.34,
      "end_seconds": 219.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Right, you know, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.44,
      "end_seconds": 234.48,
      "duration_seconds": 14.04,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.82,
      "end_seconds": 239.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "I mean, good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.5,
      "end_seconds": 259.11,
      "duration_seconds": 18.61,
      "text": "From what you've told me, this looks most like a refractive problem or early cataracts. I can't rule out diabetic eye changes yet. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had blurry vision for three weeks, mild, and no sudden loss of vision or floaters."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.32,
      "end_seconds": 265.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Yes, um, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.2,
      "end_seconds": 270.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.59,
      "end_seconds": 274.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.85,
      "end_seconds": 298.52,
      "duration_seconds": 22.67,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a dilated eye examination for blurred vision. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. We should do an eye pressure check for blurred vision. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Get a proper glasses test, and keep your sugar and blood pressure well controlled for your eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.42,
      "end_seconds": 320.44,
      "duration_seconds": 21.02,
      "text": "Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. If you get sudden loss of vision or a curtain across your sight, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Please come and see me in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.0,
      "end_seconds": 325.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.12,
      "end_seconds": 331.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.02,
      "end_seconds": 338.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "So, uh, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.84,
      "end_seconds": 342.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.32,
      "end_seconds": 347.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.03,
      "end_seconds": 349.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}